"{{Term/Store|Cooking with Koko||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Cooking with Koko}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Kakariko Village}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
After helping [[Koko]] with her [[Cooking]] by completing the "[[Koko's Kitchen]]" [[Side Quest]], she will have another dilemma the next time [[Link]] talks to her at the [[Cooking Pot]]. She has decided to make [[Hot Buttered Apple]]s like her mother used to,<ref>{{Cite|What should Koko make now... {{Big|OH!}} {{Color BotW|Blue|Hot buttered apple}} sounds good! Mother used to make it all the time! Cottla loves it too! Let's see... The ingredients are... some {{Color BotW|Blue|apples}} and...{{Color BotW|Blue|goat butter}}?|Koko|BotW}}</ref> but finds that she is completely out of [[Goat Butter]].<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|OH, NO!!}} Koko is out of {{Color BotW|Blue|goat butter}}...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> She calls herself a bad daughter and believes she will never be like her mother.<ref>{{Cite|Koko is a bad daughter who can't do anything right. Koko will never be like Mother...|Koko|BotW}}</ref>

If Link should comfort her rather than helping, Koko will shrug off his words.<ref>{{Cite|[Cheer up!] Koko doesn't need your sympathy. Koko needs some goat butter!|Koko|BotW}}</ref> Link can also offer her Goat Butter, but she can tell he is lying, as her father [[Dorian]] is also bad at it.<ref>{{Cite|[Voilà! Goat butter!] Koko knows when someone is lying. Father isn't good at lying either...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> Once she is done speaking to Link, the Side Quest will begin.

Goat Butter is sold at [[High Spirits Produce]] nearby, though it is not necessary to buy it from there. Once Link returns to Koko, he finds her lamenting the fact that she forgot the Goat Butter and calling herself a bad daughter.<ref>{{Cite|Koko wants to cook a {{Color BotW|Blue|hot buttered apple}} but forgot the goat butter?! Koko is a bad daughter who can't do anything right... Koko will never be like Mother...|Koko|BotW}}</ref> When Link offers her Butter, she will be surprised that he went so far for her and asks him to stay put while she cooks the meal.<ref>{{Cite|Is this... {{Big|goat butter?!}} Are you sure about this? Really? Thank you so much! Koko means it! Stay right there for a second!|Koko|BotW}}</ref>

Koko is very pleased with her Hot Buttered Apples and offers one to Link as a reward.<ref>{{Cite|Mmm! What a yummy smell! And that hint of butter makes all the difference! Oh! Oh! And the apples are superbly sweet too! Here, take some. It's really something else.|Koko|BotW}}</ref> She states that she is determined to improve her Cooking, ending the Side Quest.<ref>{{Cite|Koko will work hard to get better and better at cooking!|Koko|BotW}}</ref>

